<title>UK: Flemings director moves to UBS' chemicals group.</title>
<headline>Flemings director moves to UBS' chemicals group.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mark Sullivan, director at investment brokers Robert Fleming, will join the corporate finance division of UBS Ltd as managing director and joint head of the bank's chemicals group, UBS said.</p>
<p>&quot;Chemicals is a core sector for UBS. Mark's appointment provides us with significant additional capability in the sector,&quot; said Malcolm Le May, vice chairman of UBS Ltd.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
